DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       The function sseett__ffoorrmm__ooppttss sets all the given form's option bits  (form
       option bits may be logically-OR'ed together).

       The  function  ffoorrmm__ooppttss__oonn  turns on the given option bits, and leaves
       others alone.

       The function ffoorrmm__ooppttss__ooffff turns off the given option bits, and  leaves
       others alone.

       The function ffoorrmm__ooppttss returns the form's current option bits.

       The following options are defined (all are on by default):

       O_NL_OVERLOAD
            Overload  the RREEQQ__NNEEWW__LLIINNEE forms driver request so that calling it
            at the end of a field goes to the next field.

       O_BS_OVERLOAD
            Overload the RREEQQ__DDEELL__PPRREEVV forms driver request so that calling  it
            at the beginning of a field goes to the previous field.

